cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use FTAD in research, analysis or demonstrations, please cite this software."
type: software
title: "FinTech Anomaly Detection (FTAD)"
version: "1.0.0"
date-released: "2026-10-31"
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/DrGeorgOttoWagner/fintech-anomaly-detection"
authors:
  - given-names: "Georg-Otto"
    family-names: "Wagner"
    email: "georg-otto.wagner@outlook.com"
abstract: >-
  FTAD is a local research platform for reproducible fraud and anomaly detection analysis,
  exploratory data analysis and comparative machine-learning benchmarking on imbalanced
  tabular data, with leakage-safe train/validation/test protocols, validation-frozen
  thresholds and reproducibility metadata.
keywords:
  - fintech
  - fraud detection
  - anomaly detection
  - machine learning
  - reproducible research
